<p class="Terms" style="text-align:left;"><a name="term-forward-secrecy" id="term-forward-secrecy"></a><span class="TermNum">3.1.8.</span>&#xA0;forward secrecy</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_d9d015b5-af68-1e21-5836-f384fcc51db4" id="_d9d015b5-af68-1e21-5836-f384fcc51db4"></a>method such that user of revoked access is unable to access data created after access revocation</p>


 <div class="Note"><a name="_224dfb71-9d8d-f89b-5c60-150818a2d613" id="_224dfb71-9d8d-f89b-5c60-150818a2d613"></a><p class="Note"><span class="termnote_label">Note 1 to entry: </span>Refer to <a href="#RFC7525">section 6.3</a></p></div>

