        <div><a name="_531b06f8-2840-ff3b-399b-65cf17b78099" id="_531b06f8-2840-ff3b-399b-65cf17b78099"></a><h2>3.2.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Symbols</h2>

