  </m:oMath>
</m:oMathPara>

  </span></p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_3d8e1c3b-f6cc-2c60-f947-6da19256eb0c" id="_3d8e1c3b-f6cc-2c60-f947-6da19256eb0c"></a>Symmetric encryption, through the blockcipher <span class="stem"><m:oMath>
    <m:r><m:t>B</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>C</m:t></m:r>
  </m:oMath></span>, of the message
<span class="stem"><m:oMath>
    <m:r><m:t>m</m:t></m:r>
  </m:oMath></span> using the key <span class="stem"><m:oMath>
